WEBVTT

00:24.925 --> 00:31.490
The stage is empty The crowd is gone Another

00:31.550 --> 00:33.591
night, another dawn

00:36.854 --> 00:44.219
We played the part We sang the song And now we have

00:44.279 --> 00:49.343
to move along The

00:49.383 --> 00:51.765
neon heart is turning low

00:55.225 --> 00:57.906
It's just a faded distant glow

01:01.288 --> 01:05.811
Is this the dream we wanted so? I guess we'll

01:05.871 --> 01:15.476
never know We're just echoes in the city It's not

01:15.576 --> 01:24.521
so bad It's not so pretty Just echoes turning to

01:24.581 --> 01:31.618
grey We'll come back and find another day A

01:48.807 --> 01:51.148
very soft malachite thirsty

01:56.271 --> 01:57.391
Another day

02:02.312 --> 02:03.252
Another way

02:14.435 --> 02:20.816
Just echoes turn into grey We'll come back and

02:20.876 --> 02:23.517
fight Another day

02:32.571 --> 02:36.380
After the show, goodnight

